        ex:hasText "The client's global budget is €900,000 over 5 years, which translates to €180,000 per year." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assuming a similar distribution between one-off project costs and recurring run costs as our reference budget envelope, our can estimate that around 30% of The client's global budget will be allocated to one-off project costs (e.g., framing, design, integration, change management, training) and 70% to recurring run costs (e.g., platform subscription, hosting/infrastructure, model-inference costs, support, maintenance). our target gross margin is between 25% and 35%." ;
