    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To achieve our projected margin on this contract, our will need to optimize our costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given The client's requirement for data sovereignty and the need to host data within the European Union, our can propose using a sovereign HDS tier and a sovereign European model, which are more cost-efficient on the recurring side than premium high-availability tiers combined with top-tier proprietary inference." ;
