    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By working with the architect to select the most cost-efficient configuration that meets The client's requirements, our can minimize our costs while preserving an acceptable margin." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our experience in managing similar projects and our existing cost structure will enable our to identify areas where our can optimize costs without compromising the quality of service." ;
