    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an artificial intelligence solution that assists staff in staff daily activities, facilitates access to information, improves the quality of written outputs, and reduces processing and documentation times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk149> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components and innovation strategy would we propose for this project, considering we LLM stack, RAG capabilities, fine-tuning methods, explainability tools, performance benchmarks, past AI use cases, and known trade-offs as of 2024?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must support medical coding (PMSI / ICD-10) for activity reporting (T2A)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk150> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on The client requirements and we company context, I propose an artificial intelligence solution that leverages we Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities to assist staff in staff daily activities. our Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities will enable the generation of high-quality written outputs by retrieving relevant information from The client internal procedures, care protocols, and applicable regulatory texts." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk151> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To facilitate access to information, we will utilize we hybrid retrieval method, which combines lexical and semantic search to provide accurate and relevant results. utilize will enable staff to quickly find the information staff need, reducing processing and documentation times. we solution will also include template-guided drafting capabilities, allowing staff to generate discharge summaries, medical reports, and other clinical and administrative documents with ease." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk152> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we system will support medical coding (PMSI/ICD-10) and provide suggestions for actions or verifications, further streamlining the documentation process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk153> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure explainability and transparency, we will provide source citations, retrieved passages, and a retrieval trace for every interaction. provide will enable staff to understand the reasoning behind the generated outputs and make informed decisions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk154> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of fine-tuning methods, we can adapt we model to the client's specific needs through corpus curation and retrieval/prompt configuration, without requiring personal data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk155> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "If necessary, optional fine-tuning on client material can be performed, with clear data use terms defined in collaboration with the client and we compliance function. we performance benchmarks will focus on answer quality, measured by groundedness, relevance, and factual support, using a labeled evaluation set built with the client. we will also track efficiency outcomes, such as reduction in processing and documentation times, to ensure Our solution meets The client requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk156> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering we past AI use cases, including the medical-documentation pilot for a regional hospital group, we are confident that our Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities can deliver significant benefits in terms of efficiency, quality, and staff satisfaction." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk157> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging our LLM stack and RAG capabilities, we can provide a tailored solution that addresses The client specific needs and constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk158> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of innovation strategy, we will adopt an iterative approach, working closely with the client to refine Our solution through corpus selection and curation, retrieval tuning, prompt and template design, and evaluation loops. an iterative approach will ensure that Our solution meets the client evolving needs and priorities, while also addressing any technical or regulatory constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk159> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, we proposed AI components and innovation strategy are designed to provide a robust, efficient, and explainable solution that supports the client's staff in the client's staff daily activities, while also improving the quality of written outputs and reducing processing and documentation times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk16> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must take the dossier context into account where available." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk160> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client wishes to limit the environmental footprint of The client information systems and expects a solution that contributes to reducing energy consumption and relies, as far as possible, on low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk161> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What CSR and sustainability strategies would we propose for this project, considering we EcoVadis rating, carbon footprint, green hosting partners, digital sobriety practices, social commitments, AI ethics principles, and known sustainability trade-offs as of 2024?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk162> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a CSR & Sustainability officer at we, I can propose the following strategies for this project. we have achieved an EcoVadis Silver rating, demonstrating we commitment to corporate social responsibility." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk163> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To reduce energy consumption and limit environmental footprint, we will leverage we green hosting partner, OuraneCloud, which uses renewable energy and has a power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk164> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, their heat reuse capability further minimizes waste.  we will also apply we digital sobriety practices, including model right-sizing, caching, and batching, to optimize resource utilization and reduce the carbon footprint of we solution. we carbon reporting capability will enable we to monitor and report on the environmental impact of we operations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk165> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As part of we social commitments, we prioritize responsible tech through we charter signatory status, promoting gender balance and inclusion objectives, apprenticeship and work-study programs, and research partnerships with institutions like the Grenoble research ecosystem.  we AI ethics principles, including human oversight, transparency, bias monitoring, data minimization, and documented data-use policy, will guide the development of the solution to ensure the solution aligns with ethical standards and supports a sustainable future." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk166> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, we acknowledge known CSR tensions such as balancing high availability with energy consumption. we will work closely with the client to present the trade-offs explicitly, ensuring that the chosen configuration meets both the client operational needs and sustainability goals." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk167> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given we capabilities and commitments as of 2025, we are well-positioned to support the client objectives in reducing environmental impact through sustainable IT practices and responsible AI development." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk168> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our consortium proposes an artificial intelligence solution to assist hospital staff in hospital staff daily activities, improving efficiency and quality of care." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk169> a prov:Entity ;
